        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194820?u=16f166a3ba214c8dd3751fe0b302b4849e0ec0fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a new <code class=\"notranslate\">ImageData</code> constructor argument type (<code class=\"notranslate\">Float16</code>).<br>\nAlready added to MDN: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3305851936\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40680\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40680/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40680\">mdn/content#40680</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In the browser console</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"\nnew ImageData(new Float16Array(4), 1, 1, {pixelFormat:&quot;rgba-float16&quot;})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">\nnew ImageData(new Float16Array(4), 1, 1, {pixelFormat:\"rgba-float16\"})\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Further links a part of the related issue and the related MDN changes: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3294051118\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40639\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40639/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40639\">mdn/content#40639</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27547.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3307186465\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27547\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27547/hovercard?comment_id=3214471118&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27547#issuecomment-3214471118\">#27547 (comment)</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Documents <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/imagebitmap-and-animations.html#the-imagedata-interface\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/imagebitmap-and-animations.html#the-imagedata-interface</a></p>",
